GitHub tip, not the local checkout's stale base — the local checkout was
found to be behind `origin/main` in an unrelated project's pin at commit
time, confirming why the tip-fetch-and-patch method rather than a local
regenerate-and-push was correct here), verified via
`nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry kotobase-protocols-worker`
(fast-forward, server-side pin verification OK).

